<title>HUNGARY: CESI index falls, ends at 1,405.53 points.</title>
<headline>CESI index falls, ends at 1,405.53 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index fell 13.80 points or 0.97 percent to 1,405.53 points on Thursday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said on its Reuters page.</p>
<p>The index reflects trends of 72 Hungarian, Polish, Czech, Slovak and Slovenian shares.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040.</p>
</text>
